# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Only aliases that a real link is likely to use: the site has no
# client-side router, so there is nothing else to rewrite. `dist/404.html` is served automatically
# for anything that does not match a file.

# `llms.txt` addresses the skill under /skill/; anyone who followed a repository path lands here.
/docs/skill/*   /skill/:splat   301
/skill.md       /skill/         301
/skills/*       /skill/:splat   301
